            <ArticleTitle>[Help me--I do not tolerate my statin].</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>491-7; quiz 498-9</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <ELocationID EIdType="doi" ValidYN="Y">10.1024/1661-8157/a002007</ELocationID>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Statins represent the most widely prescribed drugs. Accordingly, in daily practice statin-related muscle pain and other myopathic sensations are frequently seen. In this practice review the clinical approach to statin myopathy is discussed.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
